            %h6 Example
            %p
              %strong (quantum cohomology ring of complex projective space)
              %br/
              The (small) quantum cohomology ring of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+projective+space"} complex projective space
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi ℂ
                      %msup
